---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { ANALYTICS_SCRIPT_URL, BEEHIIV_EMBED_URL, GOOGLE_FORM_URL, ADSENSE_CLIENT } from '../../site.config.mjs';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="PluginLint's tools run entirely in your browser. Nothing you paste is sent or stored. No cookies, no tracking. Which third-party services may be embedded." crumbName="Privacy">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p class="meta">Last updated 2026-10-26.</p>
  <h2>The tools run locally</h2>
  <p>The listing grader, tool-output privacy auditor and test-case linter run entirely in your browser using JavaScript shipped with the page. Text, JSON and image files you provide are processed on your device. They are not uploaded, stored or logged by PluginLint. Image files picked in the grader are only read to measure their width and height.</p>
  <h2>No cookies, no tracking</h2>
  <p>PluginLint sets no cookies and runs no tracking scripts.
    {ANALYTICS_SCRIPT_URL ? ' We use a cookieless analytics service that counts page views without identifying you.' : ' A cookieless, privacy-friendly page-view counter may be added later (TODO: name the provider here if one is enabled). It will not use cookies or identify individuals.'}
  </p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is static and hosted on GitHub Pages. Like any web host, GitHub may process technical data such as IP addresses to deliver the pages and protect the service; see GitHub’s own privacy statement.</p>
  <h2>Third-party services we may embed</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> {BEEHIIV_EMBED_URL ? 'the sign-up form is provided by beehiiv. If you subscribe, beehiiv processes your email address under its privacy policy.' : 'not enabled yet. If added, the sign-up form will be provided by beehiiv and this page will be updated.'}</li>
    <li><strong>Feedback form:</strong> {GOOGLE_FORM_URL ? 'the feedback link opens a Google Form; Google processes what you submit there.' : 'not enabled yet. If added, it will be a Google Form hosted by Google.'}</li>
    <li><strong>Advertising:</strong> {ADSENSE_CLIENT ? 'Google AdSense serves ads and may use cookies; see Google’s policies.' : 'none. If ads are added later, this page will be updated first, including any consent requirements.'}</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Use the feedback page for questions about this policy.</p>
</Base>
